{"unit_id":"QqiqiQ__dsh-session-toolkit#card-zh","repo":"QqiqiQ/dsh-session-toolkit","commit":"a5d2268a0b015d11f347ef96cc95d730239c330b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolkit（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在会话头部提供工作区迁移和 Agent 预设切换。它通过 Host 路由复制会话历史到目标工作区，并可选择归档原会话；也能为已开始的会话重组预设。适合需要整理会话归属或调整会话 Agent 模式的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 与 Host 服务，不需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:533-545","index.js:188-254","index.js:267-294"]}
{"unit_id":"QqiqiQ__dsh-session-toolkit#card-en","repo":"QqiqiQ/dsh-session-toolkit","commit":"a5d2268a0b015d11f347ef96cc95d730239c330b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Toolkit adds workspace migration and Agent preset switching to the DSH Web conversation header. It copies history into a new session under another workspace, optionally archiving the source, and can switch presets after a session starts. Requires the DSH Web client and Host service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:533-545","index.js:188-254","index.js:267-294"]}
