{"unit_id":"QqiqiQ__dsh-session-toolkit#feature-1","repo":"QqiqiQ/dsh-session-toolkit","commit":"a5d2268a0b015d11f347ef96cc95d730239c330b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolkit 的功能「迁移会话到工作区」：把当前会话历史复制到所选工作区下的新会话，并可选择归档原会话。点击会话头部的工作区按钮后选择目标工作区即可触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:328-349","index.js:188-254"]}
{"unit_id":"QqiqiQ__dsh-session-toolkit#feature-2","repo":"QqiqiQ/dsh-session-toolkit","commit":"a5d2268a0b015d11f347ef96cc95d730239c330b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolkit 的功能「切换 Agent 预设」：为当前会话选择其他预设，已开始的会话也可切换，并从下一条请求生效。点击会话头部的预设按钮并选择预设即可。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:422-527","index.js:267-294"]}
{"unit_id":"QqiqiQ__dsh-session-toolkit#feature-3","repo":"QqiqiQ/dsh-session-toolkit","commit":"a5d2268a0b015d11f347ef96cc95d730239c330b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolkit 的功能「保留迁移时的模型选择」：迁移时读取源会话最后使用的模型选项，并将其用于新会话；若找不到则不附加模型选项。迁移操作自动执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:143-176","index.js:222-235"]}
{"unit_id":"QqiqiQ__dsh-session-toolkit#caveat-1","repo":"QqiqiQ/dsh-session-toolkit","commit":"a5d2268a0b015d11f347ef96cc95d730239c330b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolkit 使用前须知：迁移会创建新的会话 ID，源会话历史保留在原处，是否归档源会话可在迁移时选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:222-245"]}
